WEBVTT

00:13:59.958 --> 00:14:05.113
Nova ekonomija mora i može inzistirati

00:14:05.417 --> 00:14:07.143
da je svrha korporacije

00:14:07.167 --> 00:14:09.879
poboljšanje blagostanja svih sudionika:

00:14:10.083 --> 00:14:12.179
klijenata, radnika,

00:14:12.333 --> 00:14:14.417
zajednice, kao i dioničara.

00:14:16.208 --> 00:14:18.006
Četvrto pravilo:

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.458
pohlepa nije dobra.

00:14:22.583 --> 00:14:26.251
Biti gramziv ne čini vas kapitalistom,

00:14:26.375 --> 00:14:28.434
čini vas sociopatom.

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:30.893
(Smijeh)